 impact of first- and second-eye cataract surgery on injurious falls that require hospitalisation: a whole-population study. Age and Ageing, 43(3), 341-346. https://doi.org/10.1093/ageing/aft177 ; Keay L, Ho KC, Rogers K, et al. (2022). The incidence of falls after first and second eye cataract surgery: a longitudinal cohort study. Medical Journal of Australia, 217(2), 94-99. https://doi.org/10.5694/mja2.51611 ; 国家卫生健康委 (2022). 「十四五」全国眼健康规划（2021-2025年）. https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2022-01/17/content_566…') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
